WEBVTT

00:02:27.351 --> 00:02:31.898
And what if our machines
could be more than just our tools,

00:02:31.939 --> 00:02:35.776
and instead, a new type
of companion species?

00:02:36.944 --> 00:02:42.491
I believe we need to embrace
who we are as symbiotic living beings,

00:02:42.533 --> 00:02:45.203
and design machines to reflect this.

00:02:46.454 --> 00:02:49.582
What if the world
was populated by machines

00:02:49.582 --> 00:02:52.585
that were more like animals and plants,

00:02:52.627 --> 00:02:55.171
instead of something
you'd find in a factory?

00:02:57.089 --> 00:03:02.011
This exploration could teach us
so much more about life,